n countries.json): Kosovo. | isa: parsed the 172 member entries on isa.org.jm/member-states (171 States plus the European Union) and matched ISA's statement \"As of 6 February 2026, ISA has 172 Members, including 171 Member States and the European Union\". Dropped (not in countries.json): Cook Islands, European Union, Niue. | itlos: ITLOS has no membership of its own; its page says the Tribunal is open to the \"172 States Parties\" to UNCLOS. I took the UN Treaty Collection UNCLOS participant table (ratification/accession/succession/formal confirmation, status as at 18-10-2026), which has 172 parties including the European Union. Dropped (not in countries.json): Cook Islands, European Union, Niue. | wbg: the World Bank Group's five institutions have different memberships; this is the IBRD list (the \"World Bank\" membership) from worldbank.org, matched to its stated \"189 countries\" (page last updated Jul 22, 2026). Dropped (not in countries.json): Kosovo. | Not included: npt (UNODA treaty database blocks scripted access), iaea (iaea.org 403), irena (no published count to reconcile; site 403)."},"orgs":{"icc":{"members":["AFG","ALB","AND","ARG","ARM","ATG","AUS","AUT","BEL","BEN","BFA","BGD","BGR","BIH","BLZ","BOL","BRA","BRB","BWA","CAF","CAN","CHE","CHL","CIV","COD","COG","COL","COM","CPV","CRI","CYP","CZE","DEU","DJI","DMA","DNK","DOM","ECU","ESP","EST","FIN","FJI","FRA","GAB","GBR","GEO","GHA","GIN","GMB","GRC","GRD","GTM","GUY","HND","HRV","HUN","IRL","ISL","ITA","JOR","JPN","KEN","KHM","KIR","KNA","KOR","LBR","LCA","LIE","LSO","LTU","LUX","LVA","MDA","MDG","MDV","MEX","MHL","MKD","MLI","MLT","MNE","MNG","MUS","MWI","NAM","NER","NGA","NLD","NOR","NRU","NZL","PAN","PER","POL","PRT","PRY","PSE","ROU","SEN","SLE","SLV","SMR","SRB","SUR","SVK","SVN","SWE","SYC","TCD","TJK","TLS","TTO","TUN","TZA","UGA","UKR","URY","VCT","VEN","VUT","WSM","ZAF","ZMB"],"source":"https://asp.icc-cpi.int/states-parties","checkedCount":125,"expected":125},"unesco":{"members":["AFG","AG